   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener>
              <dateline><date when="1942-08-06">06. AUG 1942[PS]</date></dateline><lb/>
            </opener>
            <p>Many greetings from ocean, mountains, woods, fjords! And from a good air to work and
               to think! I have written more than a whole winter in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319"
                  type="place">N.Y.</rs> Besides that I am hiking on Red Indian trails!</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Yours</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                  >Paul Tillich</rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
